sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Data Scientist
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Webhook as Webhook Server<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Controller as Spark Operator Controller<br/>8080/TCP metrics
    participant Driver as Spark Driver Pod
    participant Executors as Spark Executor Pods
    participant ConnectSvr as SparkConnect Server<br/>15002/TCP gRPC
    participant Workbench as Dashboard Workbench

    Note over User,Executors: Flow 1: SparkApplication Submission

    User->>K8sAPI: POST SparkApplication CR<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer token / client cert
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Admission Review<br/>443→9443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: API server client cert
    Webhook->>Webhook: Validate SparkConf<br/>(blocks 13 dangerous keys)
    Webhook->>Webhook: Mutate defaults<br/>(set default values)
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission Response<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    K8sAPI-->>User: CR Created

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Watch SparkApplication<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: SparkApplication event

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Driver Pod<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Pod Admission Review<br/>443→9443/TCP HTTPS
    Webhook->>Webhook: 13-step pod mutation<br/>(volumes, env, security, GPU, sidecars)
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated Pod
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Driver Pod created

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Web UI Service<br/>(4040/TCP)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Ingress (optional)

    Driver->>K8sAPI: Create Executor Pods<br/>Auth: spark-operator-spark SA token
    K8sAPI-->>Executors: Executor Pods created
    Executors-->>Driver: Executor registration<br/>7078/TCP RPC, 7079/TCP Block Mgr

    Note over User,Workbench: Flow 2: SparkConnect Session

    User->>K8sAPI: POST SparkConnect CR<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer token / client cert
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Admission Review<br/>443→9443/TCP HTTPS
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Validated & Mutated

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Server Pod
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Server Service<br/>(15002/TCP gRPC, 7078/TCP, 7079/TCP, 4040/TCP)

    Workbench->>ConnectSvr: gRPC Connection<br/>15002/TCP gRPC<br/>Encryption: None (cluster-internal)<br/>Auth: None
    ConnectSvr->>K8sAPI: Create Executor Pods<br/>Auth: spark-operator-spark SA token
    K8sAPI-->>Executors: Dynamic executors created
    ConnectSvr-->>Workbench: Query results via gRPC
